{"title": "XQ20 stereo headset", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Head-worn stereo camera with a 6-axis IMU, recording to a memory card. The supplier identified these recordings as XQ20 units. Two units were calibrated.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>Stereo</span><span class=chip>300 Hz IMU</span><span class=chip>2 units</span><span class=chip>Data not hosted</span></div><div class=vtabs role=group aria-label=\"Choose a run\"><button type=button data-vt=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Unit A</button><button type=button data-vt=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Unit B</button></div>", "glance": "<div class=vtabs role=group aria-label=\"Choose a run\"><button type=button data-vt=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Unit A</button><button type=button data-vt=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Unit B</button></div><p>Head-worn stereo camera with a 6-axis IMU, recording to a memory card. The supplier identified these recordings as XQ20 units. Two units were calibrated.</p><div class=band><div class=\"demo empty\"><b>No video on this page.</b> The values below come from the solved run.</div><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.14<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>60.3<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+5.74<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>56.3<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div><div class=v data-v=\"1\" hidden><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.15<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>60.1<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+5.72<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>35.4<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>No independent reference. These values show what MVIS solved, not how close they are to the truth.</p>", "process": "<p>The solved path of the rig around the board. Press Play or drag the bar to follow the calibration. Camera images a